        "t": 570.00375,
        "r": 539.0624499999999,
        "b": 530.24625
      },
      "content": "If  the  monitor  has  been  visibly  damaged  or  subjected  to  mechanical  shock  (for example, if  dropped),  perform  the  performance  tests  as  described  in Performance Verification section.",
      "section_id": "sec_2_3",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2_3",
